<title>BELGIUM: EU economic forecast for Finland.</title>
<headline>EU economic forecast for Finland.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Finland-</p>
<p>				     1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 2.3	  3.7</p>
<p> Investment			13.4	 11.9</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)     0.9	  1.6</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    16.0	 14.9</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	  3.3	  2.2</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		  61.3	 61.5</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6830</p>
</text>
